# Innov8 Studios Dashboard — environment variables
#
# Both of these are browser-safe (the Supabase anon key is meant to be
# public; Row Level Security is what actually protects the data behind
# it — see supabase/BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN.md and the migrations' RLS policies).
# Set these in the Dashboard's own Vercel project settings, NOT the
# public website's project.
#
# Never add a service-role key here or anywhere else in this repo. This
# application has no server-side function that needs one (see the
# architecture audit, §15) — if one is ever added, it belongs only in
# that function's own server-side Vercel environment variable, never a
# file that ships to the browser.

SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_project_url
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_publishable_key
